-- **Listed vs. available.** The manifest may list banks whose files are not
-  shipped yet. The landing page never guesses and never probes: a bank is
-  "available" only if `assets/data/bank-index.json` says so. Everything
-  else is shown (under “All banks”) as **Not available in this release**,
-  with no link.
-- **Counts.** For an available bank the card shows the *verified* number of
-  questions in the file (from the index). For a bank that is not available
-  it shows the manifest's number, labelled “listed”. The two are never
-  summed together.
-- **Ids.** A bank is always opened as
-  `practice/index.html?quiz=` + `encodeURIComponent(entry.id)` with the
-  exact manifest entry id. Ids are never slugified or derived from titles.
-  The bank file's own internal `id` is independent of the manifest id.
